{"summary":"缚猪绳是古代拴猪用的绳子，腊月烧灰入药，性平，主要用于治疗小儿惊啼、发作不定，每次用水送服少量灰末。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"小儿惊啼，发歇不定，用腊月者烧灰，水服少许（藏器）。","translation":"小儿惊悸啼哭，发作不定，取腊月缚猪绳烧成灰，用水送服少许。（陈藏器）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#縛豬繩","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}